GIMP Palette
Name: Sara Fixture
Columns: 4
#
# A palette in the shape the .gpl files shipped with GIMP and Krita have,
# written by hand for the suite: both separators, a name with a space and a
# per cent sign, and one colour with no name at all.
#

255 255 255	White
  0   0   0	Black
242 242 242    Grey 95%
128  64  32    Warm Shadow
 20  12  28
